# Build and test artifacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
# The release output: a payload tree and the artifacts built from it, both reproducible from source.
dist/

# Deliberately NOT ignored, unlike a typical project:
#   .orchestrator/          the runtime record - state, facts, journal, exec log. It is committed, which
#                           is what keeps the audit and the state alive across a clone.
#   .github/protected.txt   a list that is not versioned is simply absent on a fresh clone, and every
#                           rule that reads it still looks correct.
.orchestrator/
